  "lyrics": "[Verse 1]\nStale smoke\nWarm beer\nSame boots\nSame fear\nBand name peeling on the barroom wall\nAnother night\nAnother close-call crawl\n\nTorn patch\nBlack vest\nHands shake\nHalf-blessed\nYou say\n\"This town only knows one song\"\nI say\n\"Then scream it \u2018til the break of dawn\"\n\n[Chorus]\nJust another metal song\nSame three chords that kept us strong\nSame sore throat from singing wrong\nBut it gets me through\nYeah\nIt gets me through\n\nJust another metal song\nCheap ink words I dragged along\nIf it all fades when I'm gone\nLet it echo you\nLet it echo you\n\n[Verse 2]\nLate rent\nThin walls\nUpstairs\nFootfalls\nNeighbor bangs\nSays \"Kill that noise\"\nWe raise our fists like broken toys\n\nSame scars\nNew year\nOld riff\nSame cheer\nYou roll your eyes\n\"Haven\u2019t we moved on?\"\nI hit that note that you still hum alone\n\n[Chorus]\nJust another metal song\nSame three chords that kept us strong\nSame sore throat from singing wrong\nBut it gets me through\nYeah\nIt gets me through\n\nJust another metal song\nCheap ink words I dragged along\nIf it all fades when I'm gone\nLet it echo you\nLet it echo you\n\n[Bridge]\nMaybe this is all we\u2019ll ever be\nA scratched-up disc in a dead machine\nBut when that lonely hits at 3 A.M\nYou know every line\nYou press play again (hey!)\n\n[Chorus]\nJust another metal song\nSame old prayer we\u2019re raging on\nSame crowd roar\nThe small-town throng\nBut it gets us through\nYeah\nIt gets us through\n\nJust another metal song\nIf you remember when I\u2019m gone\nScream that hook and carry on\nLet it echo you\nLet it echo you",
  "title": "Rust on the Halo",
  "album_cover_path": "https://lalals.s3.amazonaws.com/GenImages/d0cbc417-b3e4-467a-9e69-ee55165dee78.jpg",
  "subtype": "music_ai"
}
