aste and the endless war\", \"index\": 17}, {\"start\": 62880, \"end\": 64879, \"text\": \"Against the grain he built a tower made of steel\", \"index\": 18}, {\"start\": 65080, \"end\": 67320, \"text\": \"While the critics in the city tried to break the deal\", \"index\": 19}, {\"start\": 67560, \"end\": 70080, \"text\": \"You see the numbers rising and the borders getting bold\", \"index\": 20}, {\"start\": 70520, \"end\": 72720, \"text\": \"He put the country first or so the legend\u2019s told\", \"index\": 21}, {\"start\": 72960, \"end\": 75400, \"text\": \"Navigating through the snakes and the media fire\", \"index\": 22}, {\"start\": 75720, \"end\": 78160, \"text\": \"Taking the throne and lifting the empire higher\", \"index\": 23}, {\"start\": 78360, \"end\": 80680, \"text\": \"Whatever they claim you can\u2019t ignore the winning streak\", \"index\": 24}, {\"start\": 80760, \"end\": 83120, \"text\": \"Bringing back the thunder for the weary and the weak\", \"index\": 25}, {\"start\": 83320, \"end\": 98800, \"text\": \"[Chorus]\", \"index\": 26}, {\"start\": 83320, \"end\": 85800, \"text\": \"The world is trembling under the weight of the crown\", \"index\": 27}, {\"start\": 85960, \"end\": 88360, \"text\": \"Watch the walls rise up while the rain falls down\", \"index\": 28}, {\"start\": 88600, \"end\": 91280, \"text\": \"From the dunes of the east to the marble halls\", \"index\": 29}, {\"start\": 91360, \"end\": 93760, \"text\": \"History is screaming through the crumbling walls\", \"index\": 30}, {\"start\": 93800, \"end\": 96680, \"text\": \"It\u2019s a gamble for peace in a theater of pain\", \"index\": 31}, {\"start\": 96760, \"end\": 98800, \"text\": \"Trying to find the sunlight through the biting rain\", \"index\": 32}, {\"start\": 99320, \"end\": 114440, \"text\": \"[Bridge]\", \"index\": 33}, {\"start\": 99320, \"end\": 101400, \"text\": \"The ink on the treaty is thicker than the blood\", \"index\": 34}, {\"start\": 101640, \"end\": 103880, \"text\": \"But the truth gets buried underneath the mud\", \"index\": 35}, {\"start\": 104400, \"end\": 106640, \"text\": \"He\u2019s walking through the fire with a confident stride\", \"index\": 36}, {\"start\": 106880, \"end\": 109240, \"text\": \"With the spirit of the nation riding on his side\", \"index\": 37}, {\"start\": 109640, \"end\": 111680, \"text\": \"They wanted him to fail but he stood his ground\", \"index\": 38}, {\"start\": 112080, \"end\": 114440, \"text\": \"Now the echoes of his footsteps are the only sound\", \"index\": 39}, {\"start\": 114840, \"end\": 145560, \"text\": \"[Verse]\", \"index\": 40}, {\"start\": 114840, \"end\": 117440, \"text\": \"I\u2019m looking at the headlines and I\u2019m seeing the cost\", \"index\": 41}, {\"start\": 117640, \"end\": 119960, \"text\": \"Counting up the battles and the souls that we lost\", \"index\": 42}, {\"start\": 120080, \"end\": 122280, \"text\": \"But there\u2019s a new direction in the middle of the storm\", \"index\": 43}, {\"start\": 122680, \"end\": 124880, \"text\": \"A different type of leader breaking every single norm\", \"index\": 44}, {\"start\": 125280, \"end\": 127480, \"text\": \"He speaks his own mind never fears the elite\", \"index\": 45}, {\"start\": 127920, \"end\": 130199, \"text\": \"Putting all the adversaries in the back seat\", \"index\": 46}, {\"start\": 130640, \"end\": 132680, \"text\": \"Maybe it\u2019s the strength that the people really need\", \"index\": 47}, {\"start\": 133120, \"end\": 135360, \"text\": \"To stop the silent hunger and the corporate greed\", \"index\": 48}, {\"start\": 135560, \"end\": 138080, \"text\": \"While the desert wind blows with a heavy metal scent\", \"index\": 49}, {\"start\": 138160, \"end\": 140560, \"text\": \"He\u2019s rewriting the legacy of where the money went\", \"index\": 50}, {\"start\": 140760, \"end\": 143080, \"text\": \"It\u2019s a complicated picture on a canvas of grey\", \"index\": 51}, {\"start\": 143360, \"end\": 145560, \"t