 \"Beyond the broken fences of the tired world\", \"index\": 37}, {\"start\": 150120, \"end\": 170680, \"text\": \"[Chorus]\", \"index\": 38}, {\"start\": 150120, \"end\": 153440, \"text\": \"Give us the next song for the highway ahead\", \"index\": 39}, {\"start\": 153880, \"end\": 157640, \"text\": \"Where the asphalt bleeds into the golden horizon\", \"index\": 40}, {\"start\": 157880, \"end\": 161960, \"text\": \"Let the chords strike like a hammer on the anvil\", \"index\": 41}, {\"start\": 162360, \"end\": 165200, \"text\": \"And sing the verse that sets the prisoner free\", \"index\": 42}, {\"start\": 165920, \"end\": 170680, \"text\": \"Until the music is all that remains of the journey\", \"index\": 43}]",
  "title": "The Next Song",
